WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.430
At the movies, a senior and a
teenager watch the same film.

2
00:00:04.430 --> 00:00:06.800
The senior's ticket may cost less.

3
00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:09.590
On a flight, two
passengers in the same row

4
00:00:09.590 --> 00:00:12.040
may have paid very different fares.

5
00:00:12.040 --> 00:00:14.800
Same seat, same cost to the seller.

6
00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:18.260
So why do different buyers
pay different prices?

7
00:00:18.260 --> 00:00:20.730
In this mission, you'll
learn what a seller needs

8
00:00:20.730 --> 00:00:23.310
before it can charge different prices.

9
00:00:23.310 --> 00:00:25.970
Then you'll see what happens
when a seller charges

10
00:00:25.970 --> 00:00:29.050
every buyer their own maximum price.

11
00:00:29.050 --> 00:00:31.830
Your mission: find out
why the same seat can

12
00:00:31.830 --> 00:00:33.490
sell at different prices.
